Token Merging在ViT推理pipeline中的执行流程：
```
// ViT Layer with Token Merging
for each ViT layer l:
    if TM_before_attention:
        // Step 1: Token Matching (TMatch)
        tokens = randomly_partition(tokens, setA, setB)   // bipartite
        for each token a in setA:
